      "whole_unit_approved": true,
      "decision": "approved_whole_exact_literal_under_explicit_context",
      "source_text": "\n    Definition — Norm, $\\ell_p$ norms\n    \n      A norm satisfies (i) $\\|x\\|=0\\iff x=0$; (ii) $\\|\\alpha x\\|=|\\alpha|\\,\\|x\\|$; (iii) the triangle inequality $\\|x+y\\|\\le\\|x\\|+\\|y\\|$. For $1\\le p\\lt\\infty$, $\\|x\\|_p=\\big(\\sum_i|x_i|^p\\big)^{1/p}$, and $\\|x\\|_\\infty=\\max_i|x_i|$. For $\\lambda\\ge0$ entrywise, $\\|\\lambda\\|_1=\\sum_i\\lambda_i$. The unit ball is $\\{x:\\|x\\|\\le1\\}$.\n    \n  ",
      "text_sha256": "0a2db84a7025b5967cc42de875ca28bcf4d9dfcff98035dc5d684e468f68cb63",
      "source_sha256": "cc95b1ba95fbe1577e8449843ff998817525c41368b4bae621c2791e4c55e620",
